  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.6.0: Major package modernization and dependency updates! Updated deprecated API Versioning packages to modern Asp.Versioning.Mvc v8.1.0. Upgraded FluentValidation to v12.0.0, MediatR to v13.0.0, and all OpenTelemetry packages to v1.12.0. Enhanced MassTransit to v8.5.3, Hangfire to v1.8.21, and Serilog packages to latest versions. Removed obsolete Swashbuckle dependencies from Web library. Zero build errors with modernized, compatible package ecosystem for .NET 8.0/9.0.",
